      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9962455::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting CoCrFeNiTi solid solution is chemically homogeneous and disordered.",
      "field": "hypothesis; material_initial_state; baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting CoCrFeNiTi alloy lacks nanoscale precipitates and short-range-ordered clusters.",
      "field": "hypothesis; baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting CoCrFeNiTi alloy exhibits excellent ductility.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting CoCrFeNiTi alloy exhibits excellent machinability.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled thermal aging can induce nanoscale precipitates or short-range ordering in CoCrFeNiTi.",
      "field": "intervention; structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aging comparison is intended to preserve the alloy's overall composition and grain size.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nanoscale precipitates or short-range-ordered clusters act as obstacles to dislocation glide.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aging-induced nanostructure introduces local lattice distortions that impede dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Easy dislocation glide in the untreated homogeneous state causes its lower hardness and strength.",
      "field": "mechanism; baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aging-induced nanoscale features will increase hardness relative to untreated CoCrFeNiTi.",
      "field": "hypothesis; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aging-induced nanoscale features will increase yield or compressive strength relative to untreated CoCrFeNiTi.",
      "field": "hypothesis; predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A high density of aging-induced obstacles may modestly reduce ductility.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10453588::web::018::4_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed mechanism applies under quasi-static loading from approximately 25 °C through 600 °C.",
      "field": "conditions; boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mechanism may not apply to CoCrFeNiTi variants containing substantial intermetallic phases or major compositional variations.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
